eId":221090305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":2099783136,"text":"Thank you, anyway. Here is your compensation.","nextNodeIds":[221090306]},{"nodeId":221090306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1180096528,"text":"Why are you preoccupied with this sword?","nextNodeIds":[221090307]},{"nodeId":221090307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":149794064,"text":"...I suppose there's no harm in telling you. Its name is Unseen Razor. My older brother was its proud owner.","nextNodeIds":[221090308]},{"nodeId":221090308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":1561828800,"text":"But inexplicably, it was not found on his person when he passed away.","nextNodeIds":[221090309]},{"nodeId":221090309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":2695728024,"text":"He always had that sword with him. Always. So for something to happen that separated him from it... It's bothered me ever since.","nextNodeIds":[221090310]},{"nodeId":221090310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":1818352000,"text":"Unfortunately, I've never found a single solid lead on where the sword might be, or what he encountered before he died.","nextNodeIds":[221090311]},{"nodeId":221090311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":748259112,"text":"That's it, really. There's nothing more to say. Except have a nice day.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"13310419101"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QU